        <mxCell id="EGA4EePLINQ7wEv0yXmh-0" value="" style="points=[[0.015,0.015,0],[0.985,0.015,0],[0.985,0.985,0],[0.015,0.985,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];verticalLabelPosition=bottom;html=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;align=center;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.cisco19.rect;prIcon=l2_switch;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#005073;" parent="XgJSQenSK-BKa7MVUS-T-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="383.47" y="110" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8ldjp6SLw7jpaopc9CfM-0" value="&lt;h1&gt;Legend&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;DEK Data Encryption Key&lt;br&gt;k3s A Lightweight Kubernetes Distro&lt;br&gt;k8s Kubernetes&lt;br&gt;KEK Key Encryption Key&lt;br&gt;HSM Hardware Security Module&lt;br&gt;TPM Trusted Platform Module&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="XgJSQenSK-BKa7MVUS-T-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="8.47" y="499.99999999999994" width="260" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8ldjp6SLw7jpaopc9CfM-8" value="&lt;h1&gt;Case: 3 k3s server nodes in HA &amp;amp; embedded TPM&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this situation, KEK keys are safely stored on TPMs on each of the three k8s server nodes. Each k8s server node needs to have the same KEK on each TPM. Indeed, the &quot;Raft leader&quot; cluster randomly generates a DEK seed (32 bytes) which will be stored as an encrypted object in its ETCD database. Then the content of the ETCD DB is synchronised and propagated to the other k8s server nodes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If one server node (e.g. the Raft leader) crashes and fails, then other server nodes will need to be able to decrypt the DEK in case of cluster reboot. Therefore, each cluster node needs to have access to the same KEK.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="XgJSQenSK-BKa7MVUS-T-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="500" width="580" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
